# The bot's state files are machine-written and synced from two places (laptop +
# GitHub Actions). Git must NEVER write conflict markers into them: on 2026-09-22 a
# rebase did exactly that, turning risk_state.json into invalid JSON and wedging the
# bot — scans and the stop-loss monitor both died for 8 days with positions unprotected.
#
# -merge        : on conflict keep our version intact; never insert <<<< markers.
# merge=union   : trades.csv is an append-only log, so keep both sides' rows.
risk_state.json -merge
heartbeat.json  -merge
trades.csv      merge=union
